WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.503
JEANNE SHAHEEN IS A DEMOCRATIC
SENATOR AND A SENIOR MEMBER OF

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:07.140
BOTH THE FOREIGN RELATIONS AND
ARMED SERVICES COMMITTEES.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.110
SHE HAS JUST COMPLETED A VISIT
TO THE BALKANS.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:15.615
SHE IS NOW HERE IN LONDON FOR
TALKS IN THIS NATO ALLY HUB.

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:19.552
SHE JOINS ME HERE ON THE SET.
&gt;&gt; NICE TO BE WITH YOU.

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:20.854
&gt;&gt; WELCOME TO THE PROGRAM.
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:25.992
&gt;&gt; YOU SEE THE RESULT OF
AMERICAN AND NATO SUPPORT FOR

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:29.896
YOUR UKRAINIAN ALLIES.
IT IS ALSO VERY RISKY NOW AND

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:32.298
HIGH STAKES.
OR ARE YOU THINKING AS YOU SIT

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.267
HERE?
YOU JUST COME BACK FROM CLOSE

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:38.104
TO THAT REGION.
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT GOES TO SHOW WHY

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:42.442
THIS ALLIED PARTNERSHIP WITH
THE WEST AND NATO IN SUPPORT OF

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:50.083
UKRAINE IS SO IMPORTANT.
THE SUPPLIES WE ARE GIVING

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:53.086
UKRAINE HAS ALLOWED THEM TO
TAKE BACK LYMAN, AN IMPORTANT

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.754
TRANSPORTATION HUB.
THE RUSSIANS WERE PLANNING TO

00:00:54.754 --> 00:01:01.227
USE IT AS A LOGISTICS OPERATION
TO SUPPLY DONETSK AND LUHANSK.

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:04.464
THIS HAS BEEN AN IMPORTANT
VICTORY FOR UKRAINE.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:08.535
AS THE REPORT POINTED OUT,
THERE'S A LOT MORE THAT HAS TO

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:11.304
BE DONE.
&gt;&gt; THERE'S A LOT MORE THAT HAS

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:12.472
TO BE DONE TO GAIN BACK THE
TERRITORY.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:21.080
HOW MUCH MORE WILL THE U.S. AND
NATO TOLERATE BEYOND OR BEFORE

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:25.151
THEY THINK THAT IT MIGHT PUTIN
INTO DOING SOMETHING REALLY

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.654
INADMISSIBLE?
ARE YOU WORRIED ABOUT THAT?

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:31.257
&gt;&gt; I THINK WE ARE ALL WORRIED
ABOUT WHAT PUTIN MIGHT DO.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:35.061
HE'S ACTING IRRATIONALLY.
GOING INTO UKRAINE IN THAT

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:39.065
UNPROVOKED WAR, THINKING HE WAS
GOING TO TAKE OVER THE COUNTRY

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:44.503
FOR HIS OWN EXPANSION DREAMS, I
THINK THAT WAS IRRATIONAL.

00:01:44.503 --> 00:01:49.576
THAT'S ALL THE MORE REASON WHY
IT IS VERY IMPORTANT FOR THE

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:54.314
WEST TO STAY UNITED.
I HAD AN OPPORTUNITY TO MEET

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:57.350
WITH FOUR WOMEN UKRAINIAN
SOLDIERS LAST WEEK.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:01.321
ONE OF THE THINGS THAT ONE
YOUNG WOMAN SERGEANT TOLD ME,

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:07.060
AND SHE HAD BEEN FIGHTING IN
THE EASTERN REGION OF UKRAINE

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:12.465
FOR YEARS NOW, YOU NEED TO GIVE
US THE WEAPONS SO THAT WE CAN

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:13.967
FIGHT SO THAT YOU DON'T HAVE
TO.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:20.139
I TALKED TO MY CONSTITUENTS.
WE IN THE SENATE BELIEVE THAT

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:24.978
IT IS IMPORTANT FOR US TO
CONTINUE TO HAVE OUR SUPPORT

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:29.115
FOR UKRAINE, TO PARTNER VERY
CLOSELY WITH OUR ALLIES, AND

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:31.084
THE PARTNERSHIP WE HAVE WITH
THE UNITED KINGDOM.

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:33.586
THAT HAS BEEN VERY IMPORTANT IN
THAT.

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:41.427
WE CAN HELP THE UKRAINIANS TO
FEED THE RUSSIANS AND HOLD

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:42.996
PUTIN ACCOUNTABLE.
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE A POLITICIAN.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:49.101
MANY POLITICAL LEADERS ARE IN A
BIND RIGHT NOW.

00:02:49.101 --> 00:02:52.105
THEY ARE SAYING, HOW MUCH MORE
OF THIS CAN WE INFLICT ON OUR

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:57.844
PEOPLE --
INFLATION, FOOD POVERTY, ENERGY,

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:00.246
SOARING ENERGY PRICES BECAUSE
OF WHAT PUTIN IS DOING.

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:05.117
YOU HAVE COME BACK BELIEVING
THAT THE ALLIANCE CAN STAY

00:03:05.117 --> 00:03:08.521
TOGETHER FOR AS LONG AS IT HAS
TO.

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:14.661
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT IS IMPORTANT THAT
--

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:19.799
WHAT HISTORY TELLS US IS THAT
WE DON'T STOP THE ATTACK OR

00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:24.103
AUTHORITARIAN DICTATOR NOW THAT
HE HAS OTHER DESIGNS, DESIGNS

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:27.106
BEYOND UKRAINE.
I WAS JUST IN BOSNIA, THE

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:32.511
WESTERN WALL CANS, AND YOU CAN
SEE THE EVIDENCE OF RUSSIA'S

00:03:32.511 --> 00:03:36.149
DISINFORMATION IN THE BALKANS,
OF THEIR MEDDLING, OF THEY'RE

00:03:36.149 --> 00:03:40.886
TRYING TO SEPARATE THE --
PART OF BOSNIA AND HERZEGOVINA.

00:03:40.886 --> 00:03:46.459
THEY WILL CONTINUE TO DO THAT.
THEY ARE TRYING TO PICK OFF --

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:49.162
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE TRYING TO PICK OFF
THAT AREA THAT HAS BEEN STUCK

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:51.431
TOGETHER SINCE THE PEACE
ACCORDS AFTER THE WAR.

00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:53.166
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.
IT'S NOT JUST THERE.

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:57.770
THEY ARE ALSO ACTIVE IN SERBIA.
THEY ARE ACTIVE IN CROATIA NO.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:02.308
WE KNOW THAT THE BALTIC STATES
ARE AMONG RUSSIAN INTERVENTION.

00:04:02.308 --> 00:04:08.314
WHAT WE HEARD FROM MELANIA WAS
THAT THEY ARE CONCERNED ABOUT

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:11.818
WHAT IS HAPPENING.
IT IS SOMETHING THAT WE NEED TO

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:17.123
WORK ON NOW BECAUSE IT IS IN
OUR ALLIED INTEREST TO DO THAT.

00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:20.159
IT'S IN THE UNITED STATES
NATIONAL SECURITY INTEREST.

00:04:20.159 --> 00:04:24.831
&gt;&gt; IT WAS THE U.S., WASN'T IT,
BACK IN 1995, THAT LED A NATO

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:28.167
MISSION TO GET BACK INTO THE
GENOCIDAL FORCES OF SERBIA AND

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:36.109
THE BOSNIAN SERBS?
I SPOKE TO THE PRIME MINISTER

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:37.710
OF BOSNIA.
I KNOW YOU ARE NEXT DOOR IN

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.747
ALBANIA.
HE SAID THIS TO ME.

00:04:40.747 --> 00:04:45.518
HE SAID THAT HE WAS VERY
CONCERNED ABOUT WHAT, YOU KNOW,

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:49.389
ABOUT THE SERBIAN GOVERNMENT IN
BELGRADE AND ABOUT RUSSIA

00:04:49.389 --> 00:04:51.924
THROUGH ITS SERBIAN PROXIES
AGAIN SEEKING TO DESTABILIZE

00:04:51.924 --> 00:04:53.693
THE REGION, INCLUDING KOSOVO.
THIS IS WHAT HE SAID.

00:04:53.693 --> 00:04:59.932
&gt;&gt; IF IT WOULDN'T HAVE BEEN FOR
THE SUPPORT FROM BELGRADE, I

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:04.637
THINK THAT SERBS IN BOSNIA,
SERVES IN MONTENEGRO, SERVES IN

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:06.772
KOSOVO WOULD ALL INTEGRATE IN
RESPECTIVE COUNTRIES.

00:05:06.772 --> 00:05:13.446
IT IS BELGRADE WHO PAYS PEOPLE
IN ALL THESE COUNTRIES IN ORDER

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:18.884
TO SABOTAGE THE FUNCTIONALITY
OF THE STATE, TO DISOBEYED TO

00:05:18.884 --> 00:05:24.056
THE RULE OF LAW, AND SO FORTH.
DID YOU GET THAT IMPRESSION

00:05:24.056 --> 00:05:26.058
THAT YOU WERE THERE, THAT IF IT
WASN'T FOR THAT KIND OF

00:05:26.058 --> 00:05:29.862
MEDDLING, THERE WOULD BE, YOU
KNOW, A MUCH MORE COHESIVE A

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:33.933
DEMOCRATIC PROCESS?
&gt;&gt; THERE IS A LONG HISTORY OF

00:05:33.933 --> 00:05:37.970
ETHNIC TENSIONS IN THE REGION.
HAVING RUSSIA THERE TO EXPLOIT

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:41.808
THOSE TENSIONS MAKES IT MUCH
HARDER TO GET THINGS DONE.

00:05:41.808 --> 00:05:48.948
WE SAW WITH PRESIDENT --
WELL, WHEN HE WAS AT THE UN,

00:05:48.948 --> 00:05:55.388
COMING TO THIS AGREEMENT WITH
LAVROV, THE FOREIGN SECRETARY

00:05:55.388 --> 00:06:00.993
OF RUSSIA, --
THAT WAS NOT DESIGNED TO

00:06:00.993 --> 00:06:05.431
ENCOURAGE AN AGREEMENT AMONG
THE COUNTRIES AND THE WESTERN

00:06:05.431 --> 00:06:07.300
BALKANS.
&gt;&gt; IT'S PRETTY SCARY.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:11.637
WITH THE SABER-RATTLING, PEOPLE
ARE BEGINNING TO WAKE UP AND --

00:06:11.637 --> 00:06:15.908
MANY OF THIS GENERATION WE'RE
NOT AWARE OF THE CUBAN MISSILE

00:06:15.908 --> 00:06:18.678
CRISIS.
THEY THOUGHT THAT WITH THE END

00:06:18.678 --> 00:06:21.881
OF THE COLD WAR THIS WAS A
THING OF THE PAST.

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:24.250
IT IS SO REAL NOW.
THIS IS WHAT THE NATIONAL

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:28.187
SECURITY SPOKESMAN JOHN KIRBY
SAID ABOUT THE IDEA THAT RUSSIA

00:06:28.187 --> 00:06:31.056
WOULD BE DEFENDING ITS
TERRITORY IN UKRAINE.

00:06:31.056 --> 00:06:32.725
THIS IS WHAT HE SAID ABOUT THE
ANNEXED TERRITORIES.

00:06:32.725 --> 00:06:37.430
&gt;&gt; IT IS NOT AN ATTACK ON
RUSSIA.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:40.500
IT IS UKRAINIAN SOIL.
IT WAS UKRAINIAN SOIL.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.868
IT IS TODAY.
IT WILL BE TOMORROW.

00:06:41.868 --> 00:06:46.772
WE ARE NOT IN THE BUSINESS OF
TELLING PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY HOW

00:06:46.772 --> 00:06:49.275
HE GOES ABOUT CONDUCTING
MILITARY OPERATIONS.

00:06:49.275 --> 00:06:51.911
WHAT WE ARE DOING IS MAKING
SURE HE HAS THE CAPABILITIES

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:54.447
AND CONSISTENCE THAT HE NEEDS
TO DO THIS AND HE IS.

00:06:54.447 --> 00:06:58.551
&gt;&gt; I'M GOING TO GET TO HE IS IN
A SECOND.

00:06:58.551 --> 00:07:03.022
I WANT TO KNOW WHAT YOU THINK
ABOUT THE THREAT LEVEL.

00:07:03.022 --> 00:07:06.259
WHERE IS IT NOW IN TERMS OF THE
POSSIBILITY OF TACTICAL NUKES

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:11.831
OR AN ATTACK, A CONVENTIONAL
ATTACK, ON A NATO ARMS DEPOT OR

00:07:11.831 --> 00:07:14.800
ANYTHING LIKE THAT?
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE KNOW THAT VLADIMIR

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:20.806
PUTIN IS SUFFERING LOSSES.
HE DOESN'T HAVE A LOT OF

00:07:20.806 --> 00:07:25.511
OPTIONS NOW.
I THINK IT'S VERY CONCERNING,

00:07:25.511 --> 00:07:29.649
HIS RHETORIC AND HIS
LONG-STANDING POLICY OF RUSSIA

00:07:29.649 --> 00:07:34.587
TO CONSIDER ESCALATING TO
DE-ESCALATE, THIS POLICY THAT

00:07:34.587 --> 00:07:38.624
THEY TALK ABOUT.
THEY HAVE TACTICAL NUKES THAT

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:41.561
THEY SAY THEY ARE WILLING TO
USE, WHICH IS ALL THE MORE

00:07:41.561 --> 00:07:44.630
REASON WHY THAT WE NEED TO STAY
UNITED.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.498
WE NEED TO BE VERY CLEAR WITH
VALERIE PUTIN.

00:07:46.498 --> 00:07:53.339
THERE ARE CONSEQUENCES FOR THE
KIND OF ACTION HE IS TALKING

00:07:53.339 --> 00:07:57.243
ABOUT.
AN ATTACK ON A NATO COUNTRY --

00:07:57.243 --> 00:08:01.046
BIDEN HAS BEEN VERY CLEAR AND
THE NATO COUNTRIES HAVE BEEN

00:08:01.046 --> 00:08:04.050
CLEAR THAT AN ATTACK ON A NATO
COUNTRY IS AN ATTACK ON ALL OF

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:08.120
US.
I DON'T THINK IT IS IN PUTIN'S

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.122
INTEREST OR RUSSIA'S INTEREST
TO ATTACK NATO.

00:08:10.122 --> 00:08:14.827
&gt;&gt; WHAT WOULD IT LOOK LIKE?
WHAT ARE THE CATASTROPHIC

00:08:14.827 --> 00:08:18.464
CONSEQUENCES?
JAKE SULLIVAN SAID --

00:08:18.464 --> 00:08:27.607
DAVID PETRAEUS SUGGESTED THAT
NATO, WITH CONVENTIONAL WARFARE,

00:08:27.607 --> 00:08:34.113
WOULD SINK EVERY SHIP IN RUSSIA
BLACK SEA FLEET, WOULD ATTACK

00:08:34.113 --> 00:08:36.816
AND ELIMINATE RUSSIAN TROOP
CONSEQUENCES.

00:08:36.816 --> 00:08:40.820
WHAT DOES IT LOOK LIKE, A
RESPONSE FROM NATO?

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:43.922
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK ALL OF THOSE
ARE THE KINDS OF POTENTIAL

00:08:43.922 --> 00:08:47.760
RESPONSES AND OPTIONS THAT THE
UNITED STATES AND NATO HAVE FOR

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:53.933
AN ATTACK.
I THINK LEAVING THOSE TO PUTIN

00:08:53.933 --> 00:08:57.202
'S IMAGINATION WOULD BE
IMPORTANT.

00:08:57.202 --> 00:09:01.374
I THINK WE WANT TO LAY OUT FOR
HIM WHAT OUR OPTIONS ARE.

00:09:01.374 --> 00:09:04.010
WE ARE NOT GOING TO TELL HIM
EXACTLY HOW WE ARE GOING TO

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.311
RESPOND.

